{"id":"eb5bef0eae870528","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-natural-predecessor.md","title":"自然数前驱","display":"df-natural-predecessor — 自然数前驱","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-natural-predecessor","aliases":["18-df-natural-predecessor","18-df-011"],"display":"df-natural-predecessor — 自然数前驱","depends_on":["[[18-df-primitive-recursive-terms]]"],"source_title":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_edition":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5","source_section":"2.1 (predecessor equations)","source_printed_pages":"12","source_pdf_pages":"23","source_correspondence":"definition-correspondence","source_statement_status":"checked-2026-10-13","patch_revision":"2026-10-14","patch_verification_status":"local-formalization-review; not-machine-checked","patch_review_scope":"仅修正前驱函数的 PR 成员关系之输入类型；保留前驱递归方程和代表项。","patch_source_review":"no new source-page or source-proof verification"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-natural-predecessor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-natural-predecessor</span><span>18-df-011</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-natural-predecessor — 自然数前驱"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f04544345afa1f92\" href=\"?note=f04544345afa1f92\" title=\"18-df-primitive-recursive-terms\">18-df-primitive-recursive-terms</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_title","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5"},{"key":"source_section","html":"2.1 (predecessor equations)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"12"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"23"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"definition-correspondence"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-2026-10-13"},{"key":"patch_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"patch_verification_status","html":"local-formalization-review; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"patch_review_scope","html":"仅修正前驱函数的 PR 成员关系之输入类型；保留前驱递归方程和代表项。"},{"key":"patch_source_review","html":"no new source-page or source-proof verification"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；函数项及求值见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f04544345afa1f92\" href=\"?note=f04544345afa1f92\" title=\"18-df-primitive-recursive-terms\">18-df-primitive-recursive-terms</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_{\\mathrm{pred}}\">\\(a_{\\mathrm{pred}}\\)</span> 为下式构造的函数项；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pred}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathrm{Pred}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 由下列自然数递归引入；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Lift}_1\">\\(\\operatorname{Lift}_1\\)</span> 取同一依赖中的输入转换。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pred}(0)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\\mathrm{Pred}(n+1)\\coloneqq n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Pred}(0)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\\mathrm{Pred}(n+1)\\coloneqq n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a_{\\mathrm{pred}}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Rec}(C_0^0,P_1^2),\n\\qquad \\mathrm{Pred}(n)=\\operatorname{ev}(a_{\\mathrm{pred}},\\langle n\\rangle),\n\\qquad \\operatorname{Lift}_1(\\mathrm{Pred})\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a_{\\mathrm{pred}}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Rec}(C_0^0,P_1^2),\n\\qquad \\mathrm{Pred}(n)=\\operatorname{ev}(a_{\\mathrm{pred}},\\langle n\\rangle),\n\\qquad \\operatorname{Lift}_1(\\mathrm{Pred})\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §2.1 印刷 p12 明列 pred 的两个方程；零元常函数使函数项元数正确。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-primitive-recursive-terms","status":"resolved","id":"f04544345afa1f92","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-primitive-recursive-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-primitive-recursive-terms","status":"resolved","id":"f04544345afa1f92","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；函数项及求值见 [[18-df-primitive-recursive-terms]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"a_{\\mathrm{pred}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pred}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Lift}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pred}(0)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\\mathrm{Pred}(n+1)\\coloneqq n.","display":true},{"tex":"a_{\\mathrm{pred}}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Rec}(C_0^0,P_1^2),\n\\qquad \\mathrm{Pred}(n)=\\operatorname{ev}(a_{\\mathrm{pred}},\\langle n\\rangle),\n\\qquad \\operatorname{Lift}_1(\\mathrm{Pred})\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_1.","display":true}],"bytes":1620,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-natural-predecessor]]"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"乘法、指数、前驱分别见 [[../18-df-natural-multiplication]]、[[../18-df-natural-exponentiation]]、[[../18-df-natural-predecessor]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-59","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-natural-predecessor]]"}],"outgoing":["f04544345afa1f92"]}